00:07:07,941 --> 00:07:10,940
Well, this is something I'm pretty sure you have never seen.

139
00:07:10,941 --> 00:07:12,440
OK.

140
00:07:12,441 --> 00:07:15,980
These are tube foods for U-2 pilots.

