00:07:15,981 --> 00:07:16,780
Really?

142
00:07:16,781 --> 00:07:17,940
Yep.

143
00:07:17,941 --> 00:07:20,480
The men and women flying U-2 spy planes monitor war zones

144
00:07:20,481 --> 00:07:22,780
and targets all over the world.

145
00:07:22,781 --> 00:07:26,280
U-2 pilots fly at very high altitudes,

146
00:07:26,281 --> 00:07:29,360
