148
00:07:32,601 --> 00:07:36,940
And they're up there sometimes for 12 hours at a time.

149
00:07:36,941 --> 00:07:39,940
So since pilots need to keep their hands on the controls

150
00:07:39,941 --> 00:07:42,480
and their eyes on the ground, enter one of Natick's

151
00:07:42,481 --> 00:07:46,480
most successful and efficient products, the tube food.

152
00:07:52,980 --> 00:07:55,480
Now, I noticed that these don't have labels.

