00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,380
It's spaghetti and meat sauce.

163
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:29,380
Good guess.

164
00:08:29,460 --> 00:08:30,360
Oh, my gosh.

165
00:08:30,420 --> 00:08:31,360
Yep.

166
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:32,720
So is that a piece of pasta?

167
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:33,720
Yep.

168
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:34,820
It's incredible.

169
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:35,920
And it's really good meat sauce.

170
00:08:35,921 --> 00:08:42,460
There's clearly onion, clearly has like that rich sort of umami

