00:08:42,461 --> 00:08:44,920
you get from a good tomato sauce.

172
00:08:44,921 --> 00:08:47,460
It's absolutely stunning.

173
00:08:47,461 --> 00:08:50,960
These foods in tubes really do give the mouth feel

174
00:08:50,961 --> 00:08:53,580
and the experience of actually eating a meal,

175
00:08:53,581 --> 00:08:56,000
which is different than the apple sauce

176
00:08:56,001 --> 00:08:58,580
or pureed beef and vegetables John Glenn was eating

177
00:08:58,581 --> 00:09:01,080
from a tube back in the 1960s.

178
00:09:01,081 --> 00:09:04,040
This is like the three-course dinner chewing gum

179
00:09:04,041 --> 00:09:06,200
that Willy Wonka made at his factory.

