00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,480
No way.

183
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:19,980
Is this truffle mac and cheese?

184
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:22,100
That's exactly what it is, truffle mac and cheese.

185
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,600
And you guys are using real truffle.

186
00:09:23,700 --> 00:09:25,200
Real truffle oil, yes.

187
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:27,400
It is phenomenal.

188
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:29,400
It's so good.

189
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:30,640
I can't stop eating it.

190
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:33,140
Round three, fight.

191
00:09:33,141 --> 00:09:34,380
Looks like an aioli.

192
00:09:42,020 --> 00:09:43,180
Holy moly.

193
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:49,180
The year, 1986.

194
00:09:49,181 --> 00:09:51,660
My age, 12.

195
00:09:51,661 --> 00:09:57,300
The dream, become a fighter pilot like Maverick and Top Gun.

196
00:09:57,301 --> 00:10:00,900
Well, I guess things played out a little bit different.

