00:10:36,441 --> 00:10:38,740
The crust is the thing that's breaking my brain

211
00:10:38,741 --> 00:10:39,940
a little bit here, Lori.

212
00:10:39,941 --> 00:10:41,980
The folks at Natick totally understand

213
00:10:41,981 --> 00:10:44,480
that hunger is probably best satisfied

