00:10:44,481 --> 00:10:47,320
by the act of actually chewing food,

215
00:10:47,321 --> 00:10:49,480
not just pumping our bodies with calories.

216
00:10:49,481 --> 00:10:51,560
And one day when I go to space,

217
00:10:51,561 --> 00:10:54,400
I'm definitely gonna be hungry for more than applesauce.

