00:11:30,521 --> 00:11:33,520
What we've evolved into is a culture where we think

231
00:11:33,521 --> 00:11:35,520
that in order for a meal to be complete,

232
00:11:35,521 --> 00:11:38,520
the centerpiece needs to be a large piece of meat.

233
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:42,520
But what if in the future,

234
00:11:42,521 --> 00:11:46,520
science helps us redefine what meat is?

235
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:55,520
Impossible Foods' plant-based meat alternatives

236
00:11:55,521 --> 00:11:57,520
have recently been popping up on menus

237
00:11:57,521 --> 00:12:00,560
on menus at iconic restaurants around the country,

238
00:12:00,561 --> 00:12:03,620
like Burger King, White Castle, and more.

239
00:12:03,621 --> 00:12:06,860
They're on a mission to convert avowed meat lovers

240
00:12:06,861 --> 00:12:09,400
to plant-based alternatives that look, taste,

241
00:12:09,401 --> 00:12:12,700
