00:15:30,501 --> 00:15:32,340
just how you cook it, just how you eat it,

313
00:15:32,341 --> 00:15:34,980
the same characteristics of any beef hamburger,

314
00:15:34,981 --> 00:15:36,880
just made from plants.

315
00:15:36,881 --> 00:15:39,520
If it looks like a burger and tastes like a burger,

316
00:15:39,521 --> 00:15:42,320
I'm probably going to call it a burger no matter how it's made.

317
00:15:42,321 --> 00:15:47,320
Now, if they could only just put one into a tube.

