00:18:45,401 --> 00:18:48,240
They're manufacturing and developing this robot

384
00:18:48,241 --> 00:18:51,640
to help make the pizza-making process more efficient,

385
00:18:51,641 --> 00:18:54,140
cost-effective, and standardized,

386
00:18:54,141 --> 00:18:57,880
so you can depend on the same great-tasting pizza every time.

