00:18:57,881 --> 00:19:00,480
Our system, it's not a robot, it's a cobot,

388
00:19:00,481 --> 00:19:03,120
meaning that it is designed to work in cooperation

389
00:19:03,121 --> 00:19:05,860
with human workers, not to fully replace human workers.

