00:19:05,861 --> 00:19:06,960
It's true.

391
00:19:06,961 --> 00:19:10,800
While this cobot assembles pies like any tool,

392
00:19:10,801 --> 00:19:13,660
it just doesn't work without a chef's touch.

393
00:19:13,661 --> 00:19:15,760
Fresh ingredients are prepared and loaded

394
00:19:15,761 --> 00:19:17,500
into the system's compartments.

395
00:19:17,501 --> 00:19:22,640
And of course, before anything else, there's the dough.

396
00:19:22,641 --> 00:19:26,080
Our system will handle any dough, frozen, hand-tossed,

397
00:19:26,081 --> 00:19:29,780
any shape, any size, any thickness.

398
00:19:29,781 --> 00:19:33,820
So Brian's going to enter the order into the touchscreen.

399
00:19:33,821 --> 00:19:36,580
And as soon as the system recognizes the order,

400
00:19:36,581 --> 00:19:37,980
it automatically starts moving.

401
00:19:37,981 --> 00:19:39,880
As the dough goes down the system,

402
00:19:39,881 --> 00:19:43,880
we put sauce, cheese.

403
00:19:43,881 --> 00:19:46,720
This sleek piece of futuristic machinery

404
00:19:46,721 --> 00:19:49,060
is outfitted with cameras to make sure

405
00:19:49,061 --> 00:19:52,420
just the right amount of each ingredient is added.

