00:20:15,541 --> 00:20:19,240
It's part of what makes our system unique.

415
00:20:19,241 --> 00:20:21,520
No matter how you slice it, this system

416
00:20:21,521 --> 00:20:23,420
seems like the way of the future.

417
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:32,660
And Lori's team of food scientists

