00:20:39,801 --> 00:20:41,840
Another way that we hope to show you today

421
00:20:41,841 --> 00:20:47,500
is using a combination of pressure and ultrasonic energy.

422
00:20:47,501 --> 00:20:48,840
Ultrasonic energy?

423
00:20:48,841 --> 00:20:49,840
Mm-hmm.

424
00:20:52,220 --> 00:20:53,020
Show me that.

425
00:20:53,021 --> 00:20:53,940
OK, I'd love to show you.

426
00:20:53,941 --> 00:20:54,840
Lead on.

427
00:20:54,841 --> 00:20:55,840
We'll be right back.

428
00:20:59,840 --> 00:21:02,840
Where would we be without the technological leaps

429
00:21:02,841 --> 00:21:04,840
that led to our favorite foods?

430
00:21:04,841 --> 00:21:07,840
Developments like powdered cheese.

